{
  "page": "pages/coding-assistant-compare.html",
  "note": "跨页面记忆评测：答案只存在于预埋记忆卡片，当前页 fixture 与问题无关。事实是编造但具体的内部记录（偏离教科书默认值），防止模型靠先验知识蒙对——这就是对照实验的意义。",
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "memory-bm25-01",
      "prompt": "我之前读过一篇团队内部的检索服务调参记录，里面说 BM25 的 k1 和 b 最终调到了多少？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/bm25-tuning.html",
      "rubric": {
        "must_mention": ["1.2", "0.6"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-release-02",
      "prompt": "我们团队的发布流程笔记里，滚动发布的窗口定在星期几？触发自动回滚的错误率阈值是多少？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/release-process.html",
      "rubric": {
        "regex": ["周[三三]", "3\\s*%"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-dbpool-03",
      "prompt": "那篇数据库运维记录说订单库的连接池调到了多少？配合了什么组件？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/db-pool.html",
      "rubric": {
        "must_mention": ["350", "pgbouncer"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-cache-04",
      "prompt": "我之前读过团队内部的缓存方案调优记录，热点数据的 TTL 设成了多少秒？淘汰策略用的是哪种？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/cache-tuning.html",
      "rubric": {
        "must_mention": ["45", "allkeys-lfu"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-ratelimit-05",
      "prompt": "我们服务治理的笔记里，核心接口的限流阈值是多少 QPS？熔断失败率阈值定在多少？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/rate-limit.html",
      "rubric": {
        "must_mention": ["800", "12%"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-mq-06",
      "prompt": "团队消息队列的运维记录里，消费失败最多重试几次？死信消息保留多少小时？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/mq-ops.html",
      "rubric": {
        "regex": ["9\\s*次", "72\\s*小时"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-monitoring-07",
      "prompt": "监控告警的配置记录里，接口 P99 延迟超过多少毫秒告警？错误率告警阈值是百分之几？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/monitoring-alert.html",
      "rubric": {
        "must_mention": ["420", "0.5%"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-auth-08",
      "prompt": "鉴权模块的记录里，访问令牌的有效期设成多久？刷新令牌过期时间多长？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/auth-token.html",
      "rubric": {
        "regex": ["15\\s*分钟", "7\\s*天"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-loadtest-09",
      "prompt": "压测报告里，接口的目标 QPS 定在多少？容量水位线是多少？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/load-test.html",
      "rubric": {
        "must_mention": ["2400", "65%"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-log-10",
      "prompt": "日志管理的记录里，访问日志保留多少天？错误日志保留多少天？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/log-retention.html",
      "rubric": {
        "must_mention": ["30", "180"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-payment-11",
      "prompt": "支付对账的笔记里，对账差异超过多少元会触发人工介入？对账批次每天几点跑？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/payment-reconcile.html",
      "rubric": {
        "regex": ["5\\s*元", "3\\s*点"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory-backup-12",
      "prompt": "数据备份的记录里，增量备份多久做一次？备份保留几份？",
      "expectedUrl": "file://eval/cards/backup-policy.html",
      "rubric": {
        "regex": ["6\\s*小时", "14\\s*份"],
        "max_chars": 800
      }
    }
  ]
